{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5c092150-a3de-4b58-91fb-4cd7de51f3c3",
    "name": "NumFlex Sandbox",
    "description": "Collection calquée sur celle de l'ARTP pour l'API Gateway NumFlex. Basculer entre ce sandbox et la recette ARTP ne demande que de changer la variable d'environnement baseUrl.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/authenticate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/authenticate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "authenticate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"yas\",\n  \"password\": \"yas2026\",\n  \"rememberMe\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Authentifie un compte du seed et rend id_token. Le script de test enregistre automatiquement {{token}}.\n\nChanger username/password pour basculer de compte : orange/orange2026, yas/yas2026, expresso/expresso2026. Plusieurs requêtes de cette collection exigent un opérateur autre que yas — leur description le précise."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().id_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/authenticate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/authenticate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "authenticate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "204 No Content si le jeton {{token}} est valide. 401 ACCES_INTERDIT si l'en-tête Authorization est absent.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "gateway",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
          {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "{{token}}",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
